{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3dbc9ce6e83e8e00cfa3b8bf65f3cab3d335b59cce3691791f63dc2888cfb57b", "ja": "ライブの歓声に紛れ姿を現す深紅の騎士達。\nその力は圧倒的で、アイドル達は次第に追い\n詰められていく。しかし、ふと不思議な声が\n聞こえたかと思えば、力が溢れてきて……。\nメンバー達が放った、渾身の一撃の行方は？", "zh": "在演唱会的欢呼声中现身的深红骑士们。\n他们的力量压倒性地强大，偶像们逐渐被\n逼入绝境。然而，就在她们仿佛听到了一道\n不可思议的声音时，力量开始不断涌出……\n成员们使出全力的一击，究竟会将他们带向何方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "7071f6186835e085e9b548bf91cdda33734ba96cd05359bb646f6d3c5f5453db", "ja": "ワアアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "2c89448235b4ca4debc3e4dffed7c5086c59ad024ee729f65bca489e34cf8aa8", "ja": "みなさん、今日はありがとうございます。\nまだまだ、盛り上がって……、はっ。", "zh": "各位，今天非常感谢大家。\n接下来还要继续嗨起……哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "aeff6e31c04d8bc129f8c2d92b7e42a40067cb779078ad5850938301bd355022", "ja": "やれやれ。\nどうやら、お出ましみたいだな。", "zh": "真是的。\n看来要登场了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1003_se", "source_sha256": "a40330c4564d47ecd9ea95b291f1fd27052d6cbf4b598955f5cb2aea2c6b6a6a", "ja": "ザザッ……ザーッ……ヴンッ！", "zh": "沙沙……沙——……嗡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1004_sinkunoskishi", "source_sha256": "06a3f64df3beaa9fd12717a74090338f17913eaacbf6a2934ede019adac7690c", "ja": "……警告は済んでいます。戦闘、開始。\n他のプレイヤーは、ただちに退避してください。", "zh": "……警告已经给出。战斗，开始。\n其他玩家请立刻撤离。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "7ec07b4079470a0ea1a3f5fbd10081199238195bdb28a6adb10f797694fc9c68", "ja": "やっぱり管理の人は気づいてくれませんでした……。", "zh": "管理者果然还是没有注意到……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "277f368ead25ed1405ba3182d89afae44da9a4fabd09eec6f1fa4417764440c6", "ja": "でも、戦う覚悟もしてきたんだから！\n負けませんよ～だ！", "zh": "但是，我可是做好战斗的觉悟才来的！\n我才不会输呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1042_sinkunoskishi", "source_sha256": "a200bd698f986d3d6fb05065df6425b9a57138e7848a422c9cd444f67c21d681", "ja": "非正規アバターの排除を開始します。", "zh": "开始排除非正规头像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1007_se", "source_sha256": "74476fe4177e0a279fe2ae309fed9272f816f995bf7e0c11a8e39a29021bd603", "ja": "ザンッ！　ズバッ！", "zh": "唰！嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "be30721f5268bbc10f1cb550cfee19cf8044832034ce5661415f78ca7f220d7c", "ja": "きゃっ！　もうこんなにヒットポイントが……！\nジュリアちゃん、いったん下がって！", "zh": "呀！生命值已经掉这么多了……！\n茱莉亚，先退一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "e0ea595c40a15c2c68081dcb7311b2e54f2a989f88cb15909342e6de490c8a78", "ja": "まだいける！　それに琴葉の方があたしより早い！\nこっちで隙を作るから、琴葉が……うわっ！？", "zh": "我还能撑住！而且琴叶比我更快！\n我来创造破绽，琴叶你来……哇啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1010_se", "source_sha256": "74476fe4177e0a279fe2ae309fed9272f816f995bf7e0c11a8e39a29021bd603", "ja": "ザンッ！　ズバッ！", "zh": "唰！嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9bf431c30c8ba02b79de39a76bdf39ef73ce021de59e9a614d381aaae98d209e", "ja": "ダメ～！　ふたりから、離れてーっ！", "zh": "不行～！离开那两个人——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1012_se", "source_sha256": "d19903e07d9f1f960ab3349bf5c43b2cabb33411c65b9a07212994f48367c266", "ja": "パパパパン！　パパパパパパンッ！", "zh": "砰砰砰砰！砰砰砰砰砰砰砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "0f9f40b0685ba63f30f347839f6b017f84002fb7f659a1bcacefbd466ab08793", "ja": "琴葉さん、ジュリアさん！\n今のうちに、回復してください……えい、えいっ！", "zh": "琴叶，茱莉亚！趁现在赶紧恢复……嘿、嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "1435dce5126d5a87ecb1f96d88e857d5efebe265c0e30a63365938a28a71665f", "ja": "今は、この銃身が焼け付くまで……\n撃って撃って撃ちまくります。ファイア。", "zh": "现在，就射击到这枪管烧红为止……不停地射击，射击，再射个痛快。开火。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1043_se", "source_sha256": "d420e0c18cf175e91f57b5fe87ad2f0832bb890697b1ffcb723275dc6428fbef", "ja": "ガガガガッ！", "zh": "嘎嘎嘎嘎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "6620d95d013ab8849af8a0e3cbf5152ff20bf688ff76289619ddad3f29c27af3", "ja": "わたし達の夢は、絶対……絶対に、絶対に……！", "zh": "我们的梦想，绝对……绝对、绝对……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1044_se", "source_sha256": "8c6d91f365dd68af44486963325754981e96ccbcfdba4e1aa1ebb25b040409f9", "ja": "ガガガガガガッ！", "zh": "嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b42a9821f5f0062b6a51a4e24580376333b5103d75d9c9d1fba464fb38ee361", "ja": "どんな世界でも、叶えるんだからっ！\n届けーーーっ！！！", "zh": "无论是怎样的世界，我都会让它实现的！  \n传达到吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1017_se", "source_sha256": "92fa69cd717f3b72859cf200a2fd44aa55b20db9fbac3c7d1bbc480ce9aab350", "ja": "ガガガガガガガガガガガッ！", "zh": "嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1018_300xxx", "source_sha256": "3a36bff5048d4c4f971c16db9b87eae4ca2e5c05334d12c3c187bbd03c67ead8", "ja": "（夢を叶えるために。想いを貫くために……。\n俺たちも、力を貸します）", "zh": "（为了实现梦想。为了贯彻心愿……\n我们也会助你一臂之力）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "2eadba864ea20c8785fd49240a4945b2946dbda630812b0515294d3b49835bb9", "ja": "え？　なんだ、この声……！？", "zh": "诶？这是什么声音……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1020_301xxx", "source_sha256": "1eaa30a537184a46e839f289fbba8e9200d0b15aa2e313a59229f8e1be65ba89", "ja": "（あなたの剣は速い……。でも、もっと速くなるはず。\n『閃光』の剣技、あなたなら使いこなせると思う！）", "zh": "（你的剑很快……不过，应该还能更快。『闪光』的剑技，我觉得你一定能运用自如！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "ece47760d850288b3558a38ce5a23b6cb959342aeead0ed0a1bc5300d191ae12", "ja": "な、何……これ……！\n体に、すごい力がみなぎってくる……！", "zh": "这、这是什么……！\n身体里涌出了好强的力量……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1022_303xxx", "source_sha256": "02d5ce5fdec291d2278345aab32c8d8964e417e0fee6fabff2c017ef589104f7", "ja": "（相手の注意をひいて。\nこの翼で、空を駆け巡ってください！）", "zh": "（吸引对方的注意。\n请用这双翅膀在天空中驰骋吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4d9e969fae16eb03e7262cb670934fad8f2e206eed599421d5a5d99ef09ea4e2", "ja": "あれっ、体が軽い……これってサポート機能？\nわぁ、このゲームでも飛べちゃいそう！", "zh": "咦，身体好轻……这是辅助功能吗？\n哇，在这个游戏里好像也能飞起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1024_304xxx", "source_sha256": "25f2fdbeb8d788972956b39621466979d982d46267696231d2267b7e64b1b790", "ja": "（仲間と心を通わせて……息を合わせてください。\n絆の力が、あなたの力です！）", "zh": "（请与伙伴心意相通……配合一致。\n羁绊的力量，就是你的力量！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "879a80f8a23800416c318ad32968a90bd33dad4542dfe93d0a1926bbd507e60a", "ja": "はっ……みなさんの心を感じます。\n息を合わせて……わたし、いけます！", "zh": "啊……我能感受到大家的心意。\n配合呼吸……我可以的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1026_302xxx", "source_sha256": "01bfb9adfc1e6444d2019afa73dc0ea2e474645902bbd5b14758008e3cf74253", "ja": "（初弾が全て。タイミングを見て、隙を撃ち抜くの。\nスナイパーに必要なのは、どこまでも静かな心……）", "zh": "（第一发决定一切。看准时机，射穿破绽。狙击手需要的是始终如一的平静内心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "103c83859d5dcf7b499ea1a5fbe9e93520206c284bcdbd2c7497aa280bb3b8da", "ja": "これは……心の中に静寂が広がって……。\nまるで世界が凍り付いたように……見えるぞ、私にも。", "zh": "这是……寂静在心中扩散开来……简直像整个世界都冻结了一样……我也看得见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1028_300xxx", "source_sha256": "d9a27b2fcb1ff6eb170904506ca869bb91645a4bc4d2b16de24657656ad9c9b0", "ja": "（手が届かないなら、もう一方の手を伸ばせ。\nさあ、二本目の剣を握るんだ！）", "zh": "（如果一只手够不到，就伸出另一只手。\n来，握住第二把剑吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "674174cc5b8015d13b158bc3d802e9a9096123abc62c4df573d4a28fd05a39d6", "ja": "わっ、剣が増えてる……そうか、二刀流ってやつか。\nロックでいいね！　サンキュ、誰かさん！", "zh": "哇，剑变多了……原来这就是所谓的双刀流啊。  \n摇滚，真不错！谢啦，某位好心人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "b8851c8ff53c8ef49ab50c595ec2898c1de2170e0da0618b43fb5dab653ca32b", "ja": "どうやら私達には、強力な味方がいるようです。\n後は、タイミングさえあれば……！", "zh": "看来我们似乎有一位强力的伙伴。\n接下来只要时机合适……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1031_se", "source_sha256": "0a0b8ecf86904f8ecbd1d5f1eb67d85888620fb9fcb8e16303299baadbc9870c", "ja": "ガシッ！", "zh": "抓紧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1032_motodandanin", "source_sha256": "bdcce7737c5c15575ceb6fc883f04f4d6a2252517c3a5dfa98a3b5983750e90b", "ja": "「団長殿！　今お助けします！」\n「全員でかかれ！　ヤツの動きを抑えるんだ！」", "zh": "「团长大人！现在就来帮您！」\n「所有人一起上！压制住那家伙的行动！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_07_1033_rizrntomohikan", "source_sha256": "7c7e68ad60f9ca0a1459b5f2d8451df725271c63a72cc94ee97100c3eef58858", "ja": "「お嬢ちゃんたち、最高のライブだったぜ！」\n「ハードボイルド参上！　さあ、今だっ！」", "zh": "「姑娘们，刚才的演出真是太棒了！」\n「硬派登场！来，就是现在！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
